# DepotDirect API - Basic Authentication Tests

This file contains test requests for the simplified DepotDirect API with Basic Authentication only.

### Test Credentials
- **Admin User:** username: `admin`, password: `admin123` (Base64: `YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=`)
- **Regular User:** username: `user`, password: `user123` (Base64: `dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz`)

### 1. Test Public Endpoint (No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:5205/public/status

### 2. Test Login Endpoint (Validates Credentials)
POST http://localhost:5205/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. Test Login with Invalid Credentials
POST http://localhost:5205/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 4. Test Protected Endpoint with Basic Auth (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5205/weatherforecast
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 5. Test Protected Endpoint with Basic Auth (User)
GET http://localhost:5205/weatherforecast
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 6. Test Protected Endpoint without Auth (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5205/weatherforecast

### 7. Get User Profile with Basic Auth (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5205/profile
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 8. Get User Profile with Basic Auth (User)
GET http://localhost:5205/profile
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 9. Test Admin Endpoint with Admin User (should work)
GET http://localhost:5205/admin/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 10. Test Admin Endpoint with Regular User (should fail - 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:5205/admin/users
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz